  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Bonjour à toi, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.\nMerci d’avoir pris la peine de venir jusqu’ici.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E006A006F00750072002000E000200074006F0069002C00200010000201000000002E000A004D006500720063006900200064201900610076006F00690072002000700072006900730020006C00610020007000650069006E0065002000640065002000760065006E006900720020006A00750073007100752019006900630069002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voudrais-tu jeter un œil à ceci ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500640072006100690073002D007400750020006A006500740065007200200075006E002001530069006C002000E0002000630065006300690020003F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que c’est ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007500650020006320190065007300740020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est une Poké Ball ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200075006E006500200050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il s’agit d’un Pokémon nommé Magearna. Un être\nhumain lui a donné vie il y a plus de 500 ans.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous l’avons découvert dans cet état pendant\nles travaux de réaménagement de la ville...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour le sortir de son sommeil, nous devons\nalimenter son mécanisme interne.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pourquoi nous avons besoin d’une\nMéga-Gemme spécifique à Magearna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous avions sollicité l’aide de Monsieur A.Z.\npour la créer, mais ce n’est hélas plus possible...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est pourquoi nous avons décidé de nous\ncharger de cette mission nous-mêmes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 183
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourrais-tu nous aider à récupérer les matériaux\nnécessaires à la création de cette Méga-Gemme ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPlus précisément, nous avons besoin de\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999 Méga-Fragments<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> pour la fabriquer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 189
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Magearna est endormi.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610067006500610072006E0061002000650073007400200065006E0064006F0072006D0069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous comptons sur toi pour rassembler\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999 Méga-Fragments<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> et nous les rapporter.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puis-je récupérer les Méga-Fragments que\ntu as rassemblés, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007500690073002D006A00650020007200E900630075007000E90072006500720020006C006500730020004D00E900670061002D0046007200610067006D0065006E007400730020007100750065000A00740075002000610073002000720061007300730065006D0062006C00E90073002C002000100002010000000020003F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB0072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ? As-tu du mal à t’en séparer ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020003F002000410073002D007400750020006400750020006D0061006C002000E00020007420190065006E0020007300E9007000610072006500720020003F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous remettez les 999 Méga-Fragments à Bridjet !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F00750073002000720065006D0065007400740065007A0020006C0065007300200039003900390020004D00E900670061002D0046007200610067006D0065006E00740073002000E000200042007200690064006A00650074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci infiniment d’avoir rassemblé tous\nces Méga-Fragments.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900200069006E00660069006E0069006D0065006E007400200064201900610076006F00690072002000720061007300730065006D0062006C00E900200074006F00750073000A0063006500730020004D00E900670061002D0046007200610067006D0065006E00740073002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous allons de ce pas lancer la fabrication de\nla Méga-Gemme de Magearna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Méga-Gemme est prête.\nJe vous présente la Magearnite.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610020004D00E900670061002D00470065006D006D0065002000650073007400200070007200EA00740065002E000A004A006500200076006F0075007300200070007200E900730065006E007400650020006C00610020004D00610067006500610072006E006900740065002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maintenant, utilise la Gemme Sésame de\nton Méga-Anneau pour alimenter Magearna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "*pshhht*",
